  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1101.08 Fire prevention officer",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-05-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1101.08 “Fire prevention officer” means a person engaged in the inspection of buildings or structures for the purpose of determining whether they are safe and in compliance with fire codes. The term includes a fire inspector or a fire marshal.\n\nSource. #10011, eff 10-19-11; ss by #10137, eff 5-23-12 (from Saf-C 1101.07), EXPIRED: 5-23-22\n\nNew. #13418, eff 7-25-22",
